		<RichText x="60" y="342" width="334" height="113" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="32" color="#ffffff">喧闹兽众·<br/><span fontSize="60">斯塔夫罗金</span></p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#99ffb3" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="424" height="57" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">渠联使用手<span fontFamily="HP Simplified Hans">砲</span><span>发射数枚果蔬弹药，造成</span><span color="#b8b8b8">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="439" height="143" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">渠联将手<span fontFamily="HP Simplified Hans">砲</span><span>立起，并令其向空中发射数6枚果蔬，并在玩家处落地，均造成</span><span color="#99ff85">80%</span><span>伤害。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，手</span><span fontFamily="HP Simplified Hans">砲</span><span>不会及时响应，而将连续发射4枚果蔬，全砸在渠联脸上，造成</span><span color="#99ff85">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="959" width="438" height="229" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">进行「情谊佑助」时，负责维持<span textDecoration="underline">支援护罩·刚</span><span>，维持期间召唤下落水果攻击，造成</span><span color="#99ff86">80%</span><span>伤害，若受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，则所有水果都转为命中己方护罩。低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%</span><span>生命值时，其余2位兽众将加入战斗并保护渠联，狮獒展开</span><span textDecoration="underline">支援护罩·柔</span><span>，长耳每</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3s</span><span>产生</span><span color="#bfffdf">排斥风场</span><span>。受保护时生命值不会低于</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="408" height="57" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">渠联竖着使用手<span fontFamily="HP Simplified Hans">砲</span><span>上的斧子进行下劈，造成</span><span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
