		<RichText x="9" y="1113" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">虚弱</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1164" width="439" height="135" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">支援护罩·柔：<span color="#7fbfff">48水</span><span>盾，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s，</span><span>受</span><span color="#bfceff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，当护罩受到</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>/</span><span color="#99ffff">冰</span><span>元素伤害时，根据所受攻击的元素量，扣除</span><span color="#7fbfff">4水</span><span>(2单位以下)或</span><span color="#7fbfff">8水</span><span>(2单位及以上)，击破后三者虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>。<br/>支援护罩·刚：全体生命盾，继承狮獒自身</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30%</span><span>生命值，持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s</span><span>，击破后三者虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15s</span><span>。<br/>若护罩超时未击破，那么所有成员都恢复</span><span color="#bfffbf">25%</span><span>生命值，同时提高</span><span color="#ffdfbf">25%</span><span>攻击力。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
